title: 주1_월_1교시_강의실_양나현_영문
---
<<wait 1>>
<<show hyun_idle>>
As I enter the classroom, I see NaHyun sitting alone in the very back row.
Her gaze turns toward me.
Our eyes meet.
<<choice 주1_월_1교시_강의실_양나현_긍1_영문 "Hey, NaHyun." 주1_월_1교시_강의실_양나현_부1_영문 "(Say nothing)">>
Should I say hi?
===

title: 주1_월_1교시_강의실_양나현_긍1_영문
---
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +5>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
NaHyun: Hey, {name()}.
NaHyun: Are you taking this class too?
{name()}: (Grimacing) Yeah. Right from the first period on a Monday...
<<show hyun_smile>>
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
NaHyun: This professor is the worst. (NaHyun whispers with a playful laugh.)
<<jump 주1_월_1교시_강의실_양나현_분기1_영문>>
===

